Subject: [PATCH 65/69] dt-bindings: net: qcom,ipa: Add SM7250

SM7250 has IPA v4.7, like SM6350.

SM7250 has no interconnect provider in mainline yet, so its IPA node
cannot describe the "interconnects" the schema requires.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
index 38e383051..9f18a3528 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
